      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.92,
      "end_seconds": 7.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "hi, you know, doctor long queue outside, but here I am"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.01,
      "end_seconds": 15.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "Right, yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.47,
      "end_seconds": 27.47,
      "duration_seconds": 8.0,
      "text": "Honestly, it's puffiness around the eyes in the morning, and my family pushed me to to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.72,
      "end_seconds": 31.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.44,
      "end_seconds": 33.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "No, nothing regular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.65,
      "end_seconds": 58.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "When did it begin? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.1,
      "end_seconds": 68.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "It's been going on for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.34,
      "end_seconds": 77.83,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.42,
      "end_seconds": 91.28,
      "duration_seconds": 12.86,
      "text": "It happens once or twice a day. Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.45,
      "end_seconds": 95.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.1,
      "end_seconds": 110.14,
      "duration_seconds": 13.04,
      "text": "Swelling in the ankles goes along with it, uh, most of the time. The Swelling in the ankles? That's been for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.21,
      "end_seconds": 113.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "does anything make it better?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.54,
      "end_seconds": 119.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "I, I get some relief from raising the legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.85,
      "end_seconds": 124.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "any fever or breathlessness at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.17,
      "end_seconds": 128.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "No, um, I'd have mentioned it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.57,
      "end_seconds": 133.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "any nausea, reduced urine output or chest pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.34,
      "end_seconds": 140.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "No nausea, reduced urine output or chest pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.5,
      "end_seconds": 143.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.64,
      "end_seconds": 146.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "no rashes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.11,
      "end_seconds": 150.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.74,
      "end_seconds": 164.43,
      "duration_seconds": 12.69,
      "text": "I run a small shop, so I'm on my feet a lot. I play badminton on Sundays. Yes, I live on my own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.38,
      "end_seconds": 167.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.05,
      "end_seconds": 171.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.59,
      "end_seconds": 177.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "okay, is there anything medical in your background?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.34,
      "end_seconds": 187.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.63,
      "text": "Kidney disease, for about ten years i'm not great at remembering details, so so bear with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.61,
      "end_seconds": 194.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "mm. What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.98,
      "end_seconds": 198.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "My sister has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.75,
      "end_seconds": 203.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.07,
      "end_seconds": 206.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Yes, penicillin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.69,
      "end_seconds": 210.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "let me check your vitals now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.5,
      "end_seconds": 224.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Okay, rest your hand here..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.65,
      "end_seconds": 256.19,
      "duration_seconds": 11.54,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 168 over 104, temp 37.0 degrees. And pulse is 90 beats a minute, respiratory rate 15, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.79,
      "end_seconds": 261.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Let me examine, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.52,
      "end_seconds": 264.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "take your time, no rush"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.02,
      "end_seconds": 284.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "There's pitting swelling at both ankles, and your blood pressure is on the high side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.26,
      "end_seconds": 292.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.98,
      "end_seconds": 323.08,
      "duration_seconds": 17.1,
      "text": "Putting it all together, my working impression is progression of the kidney problem. I'd also keep a medication effect on the kidneys in mind. Alright, I don't need to add any tests or treatment at this point. Alright, I'll see you out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.05,
      "end_seconds": 327.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Well, thanks, that was helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.07,
      "end_seconds": 332.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Bye for now."
    }
  ]
